### Post API Testing Examples
### This file contains sample HTTP requests for testing the Post endpoints

@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get all posts for a course (as teacher or enrolled student)
GET {{baseUrl}}/Post/course/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get a specific post by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Post/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get post image
GET {{baseUrl}}/Post/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6/image
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create a new post without image (Teacher only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="courseId"

3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textContent"

Welcome to the new semester! Please check the course materials section for the syllabus.
--boundary--

### 5. Create a post with image (Teacher only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/Post
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="courseId"

3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textContent"

Important announcement with attached diagram.
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="diagram.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/image.jpg
--boundary--

### 6. Update post - change text only (Author only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Post/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="textContent"

Updated announcement: The deadline has been extended to next Friday.
--boundary--

### 7. Update post - add/replace image (Author only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Post/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="new-diagram.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/new-image.jpg
--boundary--

### 8. Update post - remove image (Author only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/Post/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="removeImage"

true
--boundary--

### 9. Delete a post (Author only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Post/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Get all posts created by current teacher
GET {{baseUrl}}/Post/my-posts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
